# Duet-1024 NEON

Status: retained for Duet-1024 v2 on ARM NEON.

Six columns are represented as three `uint64x2_t` pairs. The permutation uses
the v2 S-box and NEON row rotations, then applies `l64` with scalar `ROR` per
packed lane to avoid NEON variable-shift rotate emulation.

See `../Evaluation_Report.md` for validation commands and benchmark results.
